<main class="container my-5">
  <h1>Archers Airlines Privacy Notice</h1>
  <p>Privacy notice version: mco2-v1</p>
  <p>We use account and booking information to provide and manage flights. We do not collect payment-card data.</p>
  <h2>Information and retention</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Account information is kept while the account is active and deleted after 24 months without a login. Date of birth is not collected.</li>
    <li>Passenger names are replaced with “Passenger n” 12 months after the last flight. Gender, seat assignment, and baggage details are anonymized at that time.</li>
    <li>Passenger age is stored as an age category and removed 30 days after the last flight.</li>
    <li>Passport numbers are encrypted at rest, masked to the last three characters, and removed 30 days after the last flight.</li>
    <li>Meal preferences are optional, require separate consent when selected, and are removed 30 days after the last flight. Withdrawal immediately resets the preference to None.</li>
    <li>Booking reference, itinerary, price, booking date, and status are kept for five years.</li>
    <li>Audit records are retained for one year.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Access and sharing</h2>
  <p>Account holders can access their profile and bookings. Before check-in, they can see and correct passenger details, including the full passport number, on the booking edit page. Co-passenger passport numbers are masked in account downloads. Administrators see operational views with passport numbers masked; an authorized Admin may reveal a full value only for a legitimate operational purpose, with a typed reason and an audit event.</p>
  <h2>Your choices and requests</h2>
  <p>Use My privacy to request access, correction, deletion, or withdraw optional meal consent. We acknowledge requests within five working days and complete them within 30 working days. The deadlines use the official Philippine and applicable local holiday calendar.</p>
  <p>Privacy contact: {{dpoContact}}</p>
</main>
